      "text": "[6:22PM] #LekkiAjah #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is busy from Marwa to Jakande due to the evening rush, but it's smooth from Jakande to Chevron Toll Plaza. \nThere's a slight jam at the Toll Plaza to Eleganza stretch, while Eleganza to Landmark is moving well. \nHowever, Landmark to Ajah is slow. The return journey to Marwa is flowing smoothly.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
